{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/bf55a74402d84a70707dbe26ef528c77.poster.avif?t=1759943232\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/bf55a74402d84a70707dbe26ef528c77.webm?t=1759943232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/bf55a74402d84a70707dbe26ef528c77.mp4?t=1759943232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The robots didn\u2019t just go rogue. They destroyed everything connected.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harmony was a scientist working on an experimental AI made from mushrooms, and Melody, her partner, just wanted a quiet night together. But when  strange behavior begins spreading among the town\u2019s remaining machines and Harmony disappears, Melody finds herself drawn into a search she doesn\u2019t fully understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll begin in a small coastal town still adjusting to a new, uneasy normal, meeting neighbors trying to hold their lives together while you uncover what\u2019s been left behind in the lab and feel your way through a story shaped by loss, mystery, and slow-burning tension. The robots aren\u2019t what they used to be, and neither are the people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/eaadfd09a2121ca03352e1ea3230ffe0.poster.avif?t=1759943232\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/eaadfd09a2121ca03352e1ea3230ffe0.webm?t=1759943232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/eaadfd09a2121ca03352e1ea3230ffe0.mp4?t=1759943232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singularity RPG is a hand-drawn, story-driven game that blends classic RPG systems with emotional storytelling, where turn-based battles and simple controls support a narrative shaped by your choices, your dialogue, and the connections you make along the way. As you dig deeper, you\u2019ll meet other characters, navigate moments of fear, memory, and grief, and confront the question at the heart of it all: what do we hold onto when everything we trusted breaks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/1fe71e005dda912ee414db4d1cada6d0.poster.avif?t=1759943232\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/1fe71e005dda912ee414db4d1cada6d0.webm?t=1759943232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/extras/1fe71e005dda912ee414db4d1cada6d0.mp4?t=1759943232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an original soundtrack by <strong>Martin Biesecke</strong>, the music builds emotional weight into each scene and carries more than just atmosphere... It\u2019s part of the mystery itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>In a world where nothing is networked anymore, something is still connecting you.</i></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3699610?t=1759943232","background_raw":"https://sha