.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/a7e423a41b68535624090b416526902577cca30c/ss_a7e423a41b68535624090b416526902577cca30c.600x338.jpg?t=1759943232"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/6e9d104c002e9941fd2c70fe45e13dc062735871/ss_6e9d104c002e9941fd2c70fe45e13dc062735871.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759943232","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699610/6e9d104c002e9941fd2c70fe45e13dc062735871/ss_6e9d104c002e9941fd2c70fe45e13dc062735871.600x338.jpg?t=1759943232"}],"short_description":"After an AI uprising, the town of Stamets Point is left disconnected and tense. When Harmony vanishes, her partner Melody begins a quiet search shaped by choices, conversations, and strange machines. Singularity RPG is a game about trust, memory, and what remains when everything else is gone.","steam_appid":3699610,"support_info":{"email":"brian@overhill.games","url":"https://www.overhill.games/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}